type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館LIVE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月20日は武道館LIVEでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(髪型はこんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスにちなんだ\nセットリストに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタの衣装での\nパフォーマンス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもこれも本当に楽しくて\nあっという間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回2期生は衣装も作って貰って\n2期生メインの曲もあったりして\n本当に嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんちゃんと見つけて\nくれましたかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/27/5521833/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"